id: ride-buddy
name: Ride Buddy
kind: gear
itemType: buddy
buddyEffect: activated
maneuverType: standard
actionCost: 1
buddyAction: ride
chooses: ride
rideSize: large
source: Core Rule
description: >
  Active, for an Action: move as many Squares as your Buddy Attribute; 2(bT) against an Exploit
  it provokes. Flyin' (the Soar Maneuver) or Dodgin' (Dodge 1(bT)).
text: >
  Ride Buddy: You always have someone to give you a lift with this guy around.
  –Buddy Effect Type: Active
  –Maneuver Type: Standard Maneuver
  –Action Cost: 1 Action
  –Effects: If your Size Category is Large or lower, move a number of Squares in any direction
  equal to your Buddy Attribute. If you are targeted by an Attacking Maneuver through the
  Exploit Maneuver due to this movement, increase your Combat Rolls by 2(bT) for the duration of
  that Attacking Maneuver.

  Upon gaining this Buddy, choose one of these effects:

  * Flyin’ Buddy. You gain access to the Soar Maneuver. If you already had access to the Soar
  Maneuver, then increase your Dodge Rolls by 2(bT) when this Buddy is targeted by a Called
  Shot.

  * Dodgin’ Buddy. Increase your Dodge Rolls by 1(bT).

  –Adventure Effect: When Travelling, if your Size Category is Large or lower, you may treat
  your Ride Buddy as a Vehicle.

---

# --- What the system does ---------------------------------------------------------------------
#
# Use, on its row, once a Combat Round while it is Active and its owner is Large or smaller: a
# card saying how many Squares they move - its Buddy Attribute - which the table moves them. It
# is a movement to Exploit: if an Exploit it provokes aims an attack at them, their Combat Rolls
# are 2(bT) higher against it.
#
# Flyin' or Dodgin' is chosen when it is given, and does its part while it is Active. Flyin' with
# the Soar Maneuver already open: 2(bT) on the Dodge against a Called Shot at this Buddy.
#
# --- What is not built ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
#
# Its Adventure Effect: Travelling, and Vehicles, are not in this system.

[passive]
if ($active == 1 && $flyin == 1) {
  allow maneuver.soar;
}
if ($active == 1 && $dodgin == 1) {
  dodge += 1(bT);
}
